            "action_name": {
              "value": "Riptide"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(conjuration, primal, water)\n\nTentacles of water rise up and attempt to Grapple all enemies within 15 feet of the minchgorm. The minchgorm attempts an Athletics check against the Fortitude DC of each creature in the area. On a success, the creature is grabbed (Escape 40). On a critical success, or a success against a creature that is already grabbed, the target begins to drown."
            },
